{"overview":"Art editor Madeleine Damian carries on numerous loveless affairs. After a failed relationship with advertiser Felix Courtland, the increasingly depressed Madeleine attempts suicide. When Jack Garet, her secretary and former lover, tries to blackmail her, Madeleine resigns and seeks a reclusive life. Neighbor David Cousins befriends Madeleine, but soon Courtland and Garet discover her whereabouts and disrupt her new life.","tagline":"Unbridled passion . . . scandal . . . murder!","cast":[{"n":"Hedy Lamarr","c":"Madeleine Damien","p":"/qH15pDp99SXcMIuGFV7fU1x4Wqt.jpg","q":"Q49034"},{"n":"Dennis O'Keefe","c":"Dr. David Cousins","p":"/xwdMxksOymeFYYi9oWtn7aocFKP.jpg","q":"Q1189404"},{"n":"John Loder","c":"Felix Courtland","p":"/4F6RnLjEuhetDl4qu8QUH3pMrf1.jpg","q":"Q1700875"},{"n":"William Lundigan","c":"Jack Garet","p":"/8iO4Ttj5QmXaRbeqUxEB4g2ftoP.jpg","q":"Q1982192"},{"n":"Morris Carnovsky","c":"Dr. Richard Caleb","p":"/2I2o2LrjnY37ptKSQwOvFFG1zkL.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Natalie Schafer","c":"Ethel Royce","p":"/t0YUFqe7nbIlTOlipbWesmJW7Wd.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Paul Cavanagh","c":"Victor Kranish","p":"/q8MWDsMJH2jXjIsr0iumnUyTZz3.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Douglass Dumbrille","c":"District Attorney O'Brien","p":"/quJC1FBvSzwNuFCQhlzXINXa7ZS.jpg","q":"Q3038059"},{"n":"Margaret Hamilton","c":"Mrs. Geiger","p":"/e2tJi7ziy5HCNO6pnpAXoxhnlfg.jpg","q":"Q257756"},{"n":"Nicholas Joy","c":"Mitchell","p":"/3flrfpogDk6kf9thyWP7uHygIiI.jpg","q":null}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dishonored_Lady","qid":"Q129049"}